WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.085 --> 00:00:03.921
- So...

00:00:03.962 --> 00:00:06.048
you two need a little help.

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:08.884
- The overall premise of "False Positive"

00:00:08.926 --> 00:00:13.263
is about this white,
well-to-do New York City couple

00:00:13.305 --> 00:00:17.267
who has been trying
for a long time to get pregnant.

00:00:17.309 --> 00:00:20.729
And they embark on this pregnancy journey.

00:00:20.771 --> 00:00:21.939
- Oh.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:26.068
- You are 100% pregnant.
[laughter]

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:29.905
- We are specifically exploring
the horrors

00:00:29.947 --> 00:00:31.490
that come up in this world.

00:00:31.532 --> 00:00:36.286
It really is a scary experience
from the inside out.

00:00:36.328 --> 00:00:39.331
- This film is not necessarily
a genre film.

00:00:39.373 --> 00:00:41.333
It's a psychological satire.

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:42.501
- Brilliant.

00:00:42.543 --> 00:00:44.503
- I wanted to create a woman

00:00:44.545 --> 00:00:48.298
who assumed that her life
was more empowered

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:50.300
than it really was.

00:00:50.342 --> 00:00:53.345
- Am I gonna be one of those women
who has it all?

00:00:53.387 --> 00:00:57.015
My career, my kids, my old man by my side?

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:58.433
- Who you calling old?

00:00:58.475 --> 00:01:02.729
- Lucy, to me, is an Instagram liberal,

00:01:02.771 --> 00:01:06.400
you know, like,
someone who has a lot of privilege

00:01:06.441 --> 00:01:09.319
and slowly wakes up to a reality

00:01:09.361 --> 00:01:13.699
that she's been kind of pushed into
that she didn't need to participate in.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:16.493
- I'm having the wildest
mommy brain lately.

00:01:16.535 --> 00:01:17.786
- [gasps]

00:01:17.828 --> 00:01:21.123
I am not crazy. They're trying to make me
think that I'm crazy.

00:01:21.164 --> 00:01:24.418
- The frame we're widening out to

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:29.131
in reviewing the power structures
that run this world are a lot.

00:01:29.173 --> 00:01:31.508
- There's a lot of voodoo out there.

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:34.845
We just want to make sure
that you get the best possible care.

00:01:34.887 --> 00:01:37.139
- [spits]

00:01:37.181 --> 00:01:40.184
- If you just think about what a woman
goes through when she becomes pregnant,

00:01:40.225 --> 00:01:43.270
she has to make a choice--
"Do I want to have children or not?

00:01:43.312 --> 00:01:45.063
"Do I give up work or not?

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:46.773
Am I a mom or an employee?"

00:01:46.815 --> 00:01:50.569
They all fit under this larger umbrella
of misogyny.

00:01:50.611 --> 00:01:55.574
- The way that our society works makes
pregnant people "the most vulnerable."

00:01:55.616 --> 00:01:57.576
- Hey...

00:01:57.618 --> 00:02:00.370
this pregnancy shit is no joke, right?

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:03.957
- Push.
- [screams]

00:02:03.999 --> 00:02:08.837
- Damn, pregnancy and horror
does go together very well.

